---
title: Holiday Ham Loaf
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Meat, Poultry, Fish
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@ground veal{1%lb}
@bread crumbs{1%c}
@pepper{1/4%tsp}
@finely chopped green pepper{1}
@ketchup{1/4%c}
@tomato soup{1%c}
@ground ham{1%lb}
@salt{1/4%tsp}
@minced onion{1%Tbsp}
@beaten eggs{2}
@water{1/4%c}

Mix and bake in loaf pan for 1 hour at 350 degrees.
